; STRICT_WITH_SIZE books as STRICT, and when several lots match, the one
; of the reduction's size: -5 HOOL {} takes the 5 HOOL lot, which the
; later -10 HOOL {1 USD} proves by finding its 10 HOOL lot whole.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock "STRICT_WITH_SIZE"
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "Buy"
  Assets:Stock  10 HOOL {1 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -10 USD

2020-01-03 * "Buy"
  Assets:Stock  5 HOOL {2 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -10 USD

2020-01-04 * "Sell the lot of five"
  Assets:Stock  -5 HOOL {}
  Assets:Cash   10 USD

2020-01-05 * "Sell the lot of ten"
  Assets:Stock  -10 HOOL {1 USD}
  Assets:Cash    10 USD

2020-01-06 balance Assets:Stock  0 HOOL
